<title>NETHERLANDS: Boskalis turnover per region 1996.</title>
<headline>Boskalis turnover per region 1996.</headline>
<dateline>PAPENDRECHT, Netherlands 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boskalis turnover per region in millions of guilders, year to end-1996:</p>
<p>    Netherlands				   270.0  vs 217.0</p>
<p>    Other Europe				  451.0  vs 317.0</p>
<p>    Americas					148.0  vs 109.0</p>
<p>    Africa					   75.0  vs  93.0</p>
<p>    Asia					    190.0  vs 227.0</p>
<p>    Middle East and Indian subcontinent   121.0  vs 123.0</p>
